      "markdown": "If you're looking for **smart lock installation in Seddon, VIC**, there are several locksmiths nearby that install and configure digital locks for homes and businesses.\n\nSome well-reviewed options include:\n\n- Precision Locksmiths Melbourne (Spotswood) – Installs a range of smart locks and offers 24/7 service.\n- Lock, Smith and Barrel (West Footscray) – Emergency and residential locksmith with experience fitting electronic locks.\n- Hallenstein Locksmith Melbourne (Footscray) – Local locksmith servicing Melbourne's inner west.\n- Omega Security Solutions (Yarraville) – Offers residential and commercial security upgrades, including electronic locking systems. [kollioulocksmiths.com.au](https://kollioulocksmiths.com.au/locksmith-seddon/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nFor a typical installation in Melbourne:\n- Standard smart lock installation: **A$150–A$300** if your door is already compatible.\n- Installation requiring new holes or door modifications: **A$250–A$600+**, depending on the lock and door type. [www.airtasker.com](https://www.airtasker.com/au/services/lock-installation/seddon-west-vic/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nIf you haven't bought a lock yet, I can also recommend the best models based on your door, such as:\n- Yale\n- Aqara\n- Lockly\n- Eufy\n- Samsung\n- Schlage\n\nTell me:\n1. Is it for a **timber**, **metal**, or **security screen** door?\n2. Have you already purchased the smart lock, or do you need a recommendation as well?",
